~ start
% Norkl: Hehehe, other goblins underestimate Norkl.
% Norkl: Norkl got coin! Norkl want brew!
% Norkl: Norkl will best other goblin, and Norkl know how!

match Globals.wantedPotionType: # this is a placeholder while we set up a global variable for the wanted potions
	when "Potion of Mogging":
		Norkl: Norkl want chad!
	when "Potion of Beautification":
		Norkl: Norkl want charm!
	when "Potion of Rapid Shaking":
		Norkl: Norkl want zoomies!
	when "Potion of Eye Colour Swap":
		Norkl: Norkl want to see with new colours!
	when "Potion of Permanent Smile":
		Norkl: Norkl want evil grin!
	when "Potion of Green Skin":
		Norkl: Norkl want more green!
	when "Potion of Curing":
		Norkl: Norkl sick! Norkl want not sick!
	when "Potion Of Baldness":
		Norkl: Norkl hair catch fire easy, no more Norkl hair!
	when "Potion of Head Size Increase":
		Norkl: Make Norkl smarter!
	when "Potion of Head Size Decrease":
		Norkl: Make Norkl head hard to hit!
	when "Potion of Creature Feature":
		Norkl: Norkl want to evolve to new creature!
	when "Potion of Rabies":
		Norkl: Norkl want froth!
	when "Potion of Change Language":
		Norkl: Help Norkl talk to enemies!
	when "Potion of Change Art Styles":
		Norkl: Make Norkl stick out like hammered thumb!
	when "Potion of Body Swap":
		Norkl: Muddle Norkl with another guy!
	when "Potion of Love":
		Norkl: Norkl wants to charm enemy!
	when "Potion of Explode":
		Norkl: Norkl wants to fly!
	when "Potion of Skeleton":
		Norkl: Norkl want to hang out with undead!
	when "Potion of Enlarge Person":
		Norkl: Make Norkl big goblin man!
	when "Potion of Shrink Person":
		Norkl: Make Norkl little goblin man!

- Confirm

=> END